    colors are not required to be connected; multi-component regions are common
  symmetry: none required; all examples are asymmetric [observed]
  transform: |
    For each input pixel at (r,c) with color C, place an NxN block at
    output rows [r*N..(r+1)*N), cols [c*N..(c+1)*N). Inside the block,
